STEP 2 -- THE RADIAL PATTERN: residual vs r/R500 (radial envelope) vs the mass-ordering (per-cluster level) -- the two-dimensional decomposition
====================================================================================================

  (a) the pooled x-curve residual vs r/R500 (does any radial trend survive the x-space removal?):
      r =   50 kpc:  x-curve resid +0.442 (std 0.128)    c_dust +1.279 (std 0.184)
